{"surface": "event", "title": "The US government is shut down on December 12, 2026", "html": "<div class=\"ev ws\"><div class=\"evh\"><h2 class=\"title\">The US government is shut down on December 12, 2026</h2><p class=\"facts\"><span>The decision on Dec 12, 2026</span><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span class=\"src\">Known from Office of Management and Budget; Office of Personnel Management</span></p><div class=\"hds\"><details class=\"hd\" data-k=\"definition\"><summary>Definition</summary><div class=\"hdb text\"><p>The federal government is at least partially shut down for lack of appropriations at 10:00 AM ET on December 12, 2026, the morning after the continuing resolution expires. It would be the third shutdown of 2026. Some Senate Democrats say they will not vote for a stopgap that leaves the Iran war unrestricted.</p></div></details></div></div><div class=\"strip\" data-count=\"6\" style=\"--cols:5\"><div class=\"sf first\" data-k=\"fig:Forecast\"><span class=\"lab\">Forecast</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:p:prop:8\"><span class=\"n v\">30.0%</span></a></span><a class=\"cap go calc\" data-go=\"x:p:prop:8\">How it’s set →</a></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:Market range\"><span class=\"lab\">Market range</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:interval:prop:8\"><span class=\"n v\">29.0%–31.0%</span></a></span></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:If Yes\"><span class=\"lab\">If Yes</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:outcome:prop:8:yes\"><span class=\"n v loss\">−$1,328</span></a></span><span class=\"cap\"><span class=\"n loss\">−0.26%</span> of portfolio</span></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:If No\"><span class=\"lab\">If No</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:outcome:prop:8:no\"><span class=\"n v gain\">+$569</span></a></span></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:Full impact\"><span class=\"lab\">Full impact</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:swing:pro